WEBVTT

40:02.542 --> 40:03.459
What will you do?

40:03.709 --> 40:05.292
With the wealth inherited from you

40:05.375 --> 40:07.542
and the wealth looted
from his younger brother,

40:07.625 --> 40:10.167
your elder son will own
three times the money.

40:10.500 --> 40:13.084
He will go on to become
a Corporator and then an MLA.
